[
  {"comment": "Sketch text, patterns and offsets (P3, P4) on OCCT, with volumes from the sketch's region areas and analytic ones."},

  {"comment": "Sketch1 (F1): 'Mitcad' in the bundled font, height 10. Each glyph contour is a curve t1.g<k>.c<j>; the counters of a and d are holes of their letters."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_text", "sketch": "F1", "text": "Mitcad", "at": [0, 0], "height": 10},
  {"expect": {"sketch": "Sketch1", "regions": ["r{t1.g0.c0}", "r{t1.g1.c0}", "r{t1.g1.c1}", "r{t1.g2.c0}",
    "r{t1.g3.c0}", "r{t1.g4.c0}", "r{t1.g4.c1}", "r{t1.g5.c0}", "r{t1.g5.c1}"]}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F1"}, "result": {
    "texts": [{"family": "Droid Sans", "fallback": false}],
    "regions": [{"letter": true}, {"letter": true}, {"letter": true}, {"letter": true}, {"letter": true},
      {"letter": true}, {"letter": false}, {"letter": true}, {"letter": false}]}}},
  {"comment": "The letters extruded 2 (F2): twice their regions' areas (23.163310686747213 + 4.7644615173339835 + 0.9505351384480778 + 7.8184813261032735 + 7.9904049634935275 + 11.679039398829419 + 14.59021071592952 mm^2); a face per glyph piece."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [
    {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g0.c0}"}, {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g1.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g1.c1}"}, {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g2.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g3.c0}"}, {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g4.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{t1.g5.c0}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 2}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 7, "total_volume": 141.91288749377004, "tolerance": 1e-9}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:side(t1.g0.c0)#0"}},

  {"comment": "Sketch2 (F3): a 60 x 40 plate (d2, d3) with a hole of diameter 6 (d4) 15 from the plate's centre, patterned 6 times round it (angle d5); the plate extruded 5 (F4): (2400 - 6 pi 9) 5."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [0, 30], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_point", "sketch": "F3", "at": [30, 50], "fixed": true},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F3", "center": [15, 50], "diameter": 6},
  {"cmd": "sketch.circular_pattern", "sketch": "F3", "entities": ["c10"], "center": "p9", "count": 6},
  {"expect": {"sketch": "Sketch2", "dof": 0}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 5}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 11151.769983530756}},
  {"comment": "The quantity changes afterwards (4 holes), then the original hole (diameter 8): the copies follow."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.edit_pattern", "sketch": "F3", "pattern": "k8", "count": 4},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 11434.513322353838}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d4", "value": 8},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 10994.690350851266}},
  {"comment": "Half a turn: 4 holes 60 degrees apart."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d5", "value": "180 deg"},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 10994.690350851266}},

  {"comment": "Sketch3 (F5): a convex outline of three lines and a spline arching over its top (area 1000), offset out by 2 (d7): the spline's offset is a spline within 1e-4 mm, the corners round, so the ring between them has the area P d + pi d^2 (Steiner) with the outline's perimeter P = 123.61009593194357. The ring extruded 3 (F6). OCCT's adaptive integration of extruded splines (geometry/analysis) is off by about 1e-3 here, hence the volumes' tolerance."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": [0, 100], "end": [40, 100]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": "p3", "end": [40, 120]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.spline", "sketch": "F5", "points": ["p5", [20, 128], [0, 120]]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F5", "start": "p8", "end": "p2"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.offset", "sketch": "F5", "curves": ["c1", "c4", "c6", "c9"], "distance": 2},
  {"expect": {"sketch": "Sketch3", "regions": ["r{c1[c9,c4],c4[c1,c6],c6[c4,c9],c9[c6,c1]}",
    "r{c10[c17,c14],c11[c14,c15],c12[c15,c16],c13[c16,c17],c14[c10,c11],c15[c11,c12],c16[c12,c13],c17[c13,c10]}"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5",
    "region": "r{c10[c17,c14],c11[c14,c15],c12[c15,c16],c13[c16,c17],c14[c10,c11],c15[c11,c12],c16[c12,c13],c17[c13,c10]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 3}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"regions": [{"area": 1000}, {"area": 259.7865624782463}]}, "tolerance": 1e-9}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F6.b0", "volume": 779.3596874347389, "tolerance": 2e-3}},
  {"comment": "The distance changes afterwards (1): 3 (P + pi); the side flips, inside: trimmed corners, no arcs."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.edit_offset", "sketch": "F5", "offset": "k1", "distance": 1},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"regions": [{"area": 1000}, {"area": 126.75168858553336}]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F6.b0", "volume": 380.2550657566001, "tolerance": 2e-3}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.edit_offset", "sketch": "F5", "offset": "k1", "flip": true},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "sketch", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"offsets": [{"left": true, "results": ["c10", "c11", "c12", "c13"]}]}}}
]
